Package: libatk1.0-0
Version: @DEB_LIBATK_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/atk
Depends: libglib2.0-0
Description: ATK accessibility toolkit
 ATK is a toolkit providing accessibility interfaces for applications or other
 toolkits. By implementing these interfaces, those other toolkits or
 applications can be used with tools such as screen readers, magnifiers, and
 other alternative input devices.
 .
 This package contains the shared libraries.
